<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Storebrand.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Storebrand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co CV has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Storebrand ASA, lead manager Merrill Lynch International said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    47.50 NOK		 PREMIUM	13.94 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.45 NOK		  GEARING	7.34 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   06.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	28.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  47.35 NOK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
